  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "You Chan stands in front of Qin Bai He to defend. Qin Bai He breathes in deeply. Her black hair spreads out as countless flower petals descend. Within the fragrant flower petals that rain down, Fang Yuan tells her that this killer move fragrant flowery words will not work, and not to waste her effort. He then wills countless purple stars to descend. You Chan’s rain shield and Qin Bai He’s flowers suffer terrible damage.",
